{
  "block": "b2_98_180",
  "events": [
    {
      "from": 98,
      "to": 108,
      "source": "and while it's easy to laugh at these kind of narratives",
      "text": "虽然人们很容易嘲笑这类叙事，"
    },
    {
      "from": 109,
      "to": 122,
      "source": "the fact remains that these sort of articles got millions of views and eyeballs",
      "text": "但事实是，这类文章获得了数百万的浏览量和关注。"
    },
    {
      "from": 123,
      "to": 126,
      "source": "they shaped public opinion",
      "text": "它们塑造了公众舆论，"
    },
    {
      "from": 127,
      "to": 144,
      "source": "and all i could really think looking at these even long before the invasion was what about china",
      "text": "而我在看这些文章时，甚至在入侵前很久，真正能想到的只有：中国呢？"
    },
    {
      "from": 145,
      "to": 163,
      "source": "because while i feel like russia does a very good job of exaggerating its international reputation and military capabilities",
      "text": "因为我觉得，虽然俄罗斯非常擅长夸大其国际声誉和军事能力，"
    },
    {
      "from": 164,
      "to": 169,
      "source": "china's modernization efforts are often undersold",
      "text": "但中国的现代化努力却常被低估。"
    },
    {
      "from": 170,
      "to": 180,
      "source": "now of course there are lots of varied voices out there",
      "text": "当然，现在外头有各种各样的声音，"
    }
  ]
}

